BT /F1 8.7 Tf 47 679.00 Td (Name: ______________________________   Index no: ______________________) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 651.00 Td (01. A severe rise in intracranial pressure produces systemic hypertension with reflex) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 636.30 Td (bradycardia. What is this response?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 617.60 Td (A. Lung hypoxia reflex.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 602.90 Td (B. Atrial stretch reflex.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 588.20 Td (C. Bainbridge reflex.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 573.50 Td (D. Cushing reflex.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 547.80 Td (02. Which pressure relationship helps prevent fluid accumulation in normal pulmonary) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 533.10 Td (alveoli?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 514.40 Td (A. Pulmonary capillary pressure consistently exceeds systemic arterial pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 499.70 Td (B. Absence of plasma proteins in pulmonary capillaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 485.00 Td (C. Relatively low pulmonary capillary hydrostatic pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 470.30 Td (D. Higher alveolar protein pressure than in capillary plasma.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 444.60 Td (03. A cuff that is far too small is used on a large upper arm. Which measurement error) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 429.90 Td (is likely?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 411.20 Td (A. No systematic effect on cuff pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 396.50 Td (B. An undersized cuff gives a falsely high reading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 381.80 Td (C. Only diastolic pressure becomes unmeasurable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 367.10 Td (D. Falsely low BP from excessive arterial unloading.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 341.40 Td (04. The CSF volume is about 150 mL and production is 550 mL/day. Approximately how many) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 326.70 Td (complete turnovers occur per day?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 308.00 Td (A. About 4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 293.30 Td (B. About 2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 278.60 Td (C. About 1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 263.90 Td (D. About 6.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 238.20 Td (05. Increasing capillary hydrostatic pressure while other Starling forces stay) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 223.50 Td (unchanged tends to produce what?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 204.80 Td (A. Decreased outward fluid filtration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 190.10 Td (B. More fluid filtration into tissues.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 175.40 Td (C. Reversal of lymphatic flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 160.70 Td (D. Increased plasma oncotic attraction.) Tj ET
