BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 316.50 Td (A. Electrical excitation normally precedes the mechanical response of cardiac muscle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 301.80 Td (B. Mechanical contraction normally finishes before electrical activation begins in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 288.60 Td (chamber.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 273.90 Td (C. The T wave must occur before either chamber can begin contraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 259.20 Td (D. Atrial and ventricular pressures directly create the corresponding ECG waves.) Tj ET
