BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 218.80 Td (views?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 200.10 Td (A. They replace voltage measurement with intracardiac pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 185.40 Td (B. They remove the need to record the frontal electrical plane.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 170.70 Td (C. They isolate atrial electrical activity from ventricular activity.) Tj ET
