BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 699.90 Td (B. Increased venular drainage with reduced capillary entry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 685.20 Td (C. Open capillary entry with constricted venules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 670.50 Td (D. Precapillary constriction with widened venous outlets.) Tj ET
