BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 582.00 Td (C. The two leads record different mechanical contractions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 567.30 Td (D. Atrial and ventricular activity alternate between the leads on each beat.) Tj ET
