BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 526.90 Td (direct effect on systemic flow resistance?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 508.20 Td (A. Lower viscosity and lower total vascular resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 493.50 Td (B. Higher viscosity and lower resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 478.80 Td (C. Higher viscosity and higher resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 464.10 Td (D. Lower viscosity and higher resistance.) Tj ET
