BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 423.70 Td (steady. What most directly increases its blood supply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 405.00 Td (A. Its large veins reduce their compliance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 390.30 Td (B. Its arteries increase their driving pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 375.60 Td (C. Its local arterioles reduce their resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 360.90 Td (D. Its local capillaries develop stronger contractions.) Tj ET
