BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 320.50 Td (II record?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 301.80 Td (A. -0.2 mV, from using the third lead alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 287.10 Td (B. +0.6 mV, from adding their magnitudes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 272.40 Td (C. +0.2 mV, from adding the signed voltages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 257.70 Td (D. -0.6 mV, from subtracting the two values.) Tj ET
