BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 748.00 Td (18. What physiological purpose is served by slow conduction through the AV node?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 729.30 Td (A. It prevents the impulse from ever reaching the ventricular myocardium.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 714.60 Td (B. It ensures ventricles eject before the atria contract.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 699.90 Td (C. It allows the aortic valve to remain open during atrial systole.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 685.20 Td (D. It allows atrial contraction to finish ventricular filling.) Tj ET
