BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 644.80 Td (balance?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 626.10 Td (A. The glycocalyx regulates filtration; lymph returns excess fluid.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 611.40 Td (B. Lymphatic vessels play no role when hydrostatic pressure is normal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 596.70 Td (C. Most capillaries continuously reabsorb nearly all filtered fluid at their venous ends.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 582.00 Td (D. Interstitial proteins do not affect exchange at any capillary.) Tj ET
