BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 522.90 Td (A. Histamine-related dilatation with increased capillary permeability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 508.20 Td (B. Generalised constriction with reduced capillary permeability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 493.50 Td (C. Increased myocardial pump function with reduced venous capacitance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 478.80 Td (D. Selective haemorrhage into the gastrointestinal tract.) Tj ET
