BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 434.40 Td (A. It increases right atrial pressure and reduces abdominal pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 419.70 Td (B. It closes all systemic venous valves simultaneously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 405.00 Td (C. It increases peripheral venous capacitance until return stops.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 390.30 Td (D. Lower chest pressure draws venous blood toward the heart.) Tj ET
