BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 331.20 Td (A. Active hyperaemia driven by ongoing tissue metabolism.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 316.50 Td (B. Reactive hyperaemia following a temporary flow block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 301.80 Td (C. Baroreflex vasodilation after systemic arterial pressure rises.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 287.10 Td (D. Autoregulation that holds its flow at rest level.) Tj ET
