BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 242.70 Td (A. It prevents further fluid filtration from capillaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 228.00 Td (B. It depresses contraction and catecholamine responses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 213.30 Td (C. It directly restores aerobic ATP production.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 198.60 Td (D. It increases ventricular force and vascular responsiveness.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 172.90 Td (24. Which of these locally released substances dilates arterioles?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 154.20 Td (A. Histamine) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 139.50 Td (B. Endothelin-1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 124.80 Td (C. Serotonin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 110.10 Td (D. Angiotensin II) Tj ET
