BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 670.50 Td (D. Blood flow to all organs must remain normal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.1 Tf 47 644.80 Td (32. Why can chronic widespread alveolar hypoxia lead to pulmonary hypertension?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 626.10 Td (A. Persistent hypoxia opens every pulmonary capillary without resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 611.40 Td (B. Persistent hypoxic constriction increases lung resistance.) Tj ET
